  "body": "I recently tried to use `<{input/type/file}>` in a Bikeshed spec, expecting the resulting link to go to [the definition](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#file-upload-state-%28type=file%29) of `<input type=file>`, but instead I got this Bikeshed error:\r\n\r\n> LINK ERROR: No 'attr-value' refs found for 'file' with for='input/type'.\r\n",
